        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Release Notes</h2>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(wal)</em> Correct slot-range endianness so pruning and lookups work (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4812810009" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1045" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1045/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1045">#1045</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cli)</em> Make wal-integrity tool robust to synthetic entries and discontinuities (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4813450290" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1046" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1046/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1046">#1046</a>)</li>
<li><em>(core)</em> Unify store catch-up policy after crash (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4818303956" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1048" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1048/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1048">#1048</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Add missing enacted governance proposals to hacks.rs (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4838220616" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1052" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1052/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1052">#1052</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Inject Plutus POSIXTime in milliseconds for mempool validation (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4729110181" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1028" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1028/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1028">#1028</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🚜 Refactor</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(sync)</em> Add apply-side block-sequence continuity guard (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4819485266" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1049" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1049/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1049">#1049</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>
<ul>
<li>Document issue label structure in CONTRIBUTING (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4745474054" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1030" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1030/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1030">#1030</a>)</li>
<li>Add architecture section describing internals (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4794656416" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1044" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1044/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1044">#1044</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🔧 Continuous Integration</h3>
<ul>
<li>Harden Rust CI (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4836540299" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1051" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1051/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1051">#1051</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🧪 Testing</h3>
<ul>
<li>Harden housekeeping test coverage (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4814221236" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1047" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1047/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1047">#1047</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>
<ul>
<li>Link high-stakes TODOs to tracking issues (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4794379751" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1043" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1043/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1043">#1043</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Install dolos 1.4.0</h2>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via shell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.4.0/dolos-installer.sh | sh"><pre>curl --proto <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">'</span>=https<span class="pl-pds">'</span></span> --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.4.0/dolos-installer.sh <span class="pl-k">|</span> sh</pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c &quot;irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.4.0/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex&quot;"><pre>powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">"</span>irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.4.0/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex<span class="pl-pds">"</span></span></pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="brew install txpipe/tap/dolos"><pre>brew install txpipe/tap/dolos</pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries into your npm project</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="npm install @txpipe/dolos@1.4.0"><pre>npm install @txpipe/dolos@1.4.0</pre></div>
