<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.3.2/dolos-installer.sh | sh"><pre>curl --proto <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">'</span>=https<span class="pl-pds">'</span></span> --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.3.2/dolos-installer.sh <span class="pl-k">|</span> sh</pre></div>
