<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c &quot;irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.3.2/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex&quot;"><pre>powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">"</span>irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.3.2/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex<span class="pl-pds">"</span></span></pre></div>
