        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Release Notes</h2>
<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(utxorpc)</em> Expose configurable HTTP/2 transport tuning (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4631061310" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1011" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1011/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1011">#1011</a>)</li>
<li><em>(utxorpc)</em> Honor field_mask in Sync service to skip unused block representations (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4631402348" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1012" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1012/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1012">#1012</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Surface lagging pool snapshots in RUPD instead of obscure panic (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4683317254" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1016" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1016/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1016">#1016</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Fail loud on lagging pool snapshots and unfinished epoch boundaries (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4686134550" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1017" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1017/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1017">#1017</a>)</li>
<li><em>(minibf)</em> Source address-utxo tx_hash from TxoRef, not archive block_data (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4574623607" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1009" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1009/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1009">#1009</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>
<ul>
<li>Re-generate wiped-out changelog</li>
</ul>
<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Add more gov proposal mappings (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4633190329" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1013" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1013/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1013">#1013</a>)</li>
<li>Switch snapshot source to R2 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4656465526" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1014" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1014/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1014">#1014</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Update gov proposal mappings (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4700572884" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1023" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1023/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1023">#1023</a>)</li>
<li><em>(trp)</em> Bump tx3-cardano and tx3-resolver to 0.22.0 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4700500279" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1022" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1022/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1022">#1022</a>)</li>
<li>Bump pallas to 1.1.1 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4700866443" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1024" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1024/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1024">#1024</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Install dolos 1.3.0</h2>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via shell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.3.0/dolos-installer.sh | sh"><pre>curl --proto <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">'</span>=https<span class="pl-pds">'</span></span> --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.3.0/dolos-installer.sh <span class="pl-k">|</span> sh</pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c &quot;irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.3.0/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex&quot;"><pre>powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">"</span>irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.3.0/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex<span class="pl-pds">"</span></span></pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="brew install txpipe/tap/dolos"><pre>brew install txpipe/tap/dolos</pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries into your npm project</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="npm install @txpipe/dolos@1.3.0"><pre>npm install @txpipe/dolos@1.3.0</pre></div>
