        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Release Notes</h2>
<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(utxorpc)</em> Support certificate pattern matching in the <code>watch</code> service (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4401984896" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/994" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/994/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/994">#994</a>)</li>
<li><em>(utxorpc)</em> Honor height &amp; hash params in dump history calls (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4401412695" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/993" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/993/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/993">#993</a>)</li>
<li><em>(trp)</em> Populate reference script expression in TRP UTxO mapping (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4554412269" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1007" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1007/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1007">#1007</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(utxorpc)</em> Honor search of utxo by policy id and asset name (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4401229104" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/992" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/992/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/992">#992</a>)</li>
<li><em>(u5c)</em> Populate block_ref in AnyUtxoData via block_by_tx_hash (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4503850344" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1000" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1000/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1000">#1000</a>)</li>
<li><em>(u5c)</em> Convert ChainPoint/BlockRef timestamp from seconds to ms (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4539807086" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1003" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1003/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1003">#1003</a>)</li>
<li><em>(testing)</em> Use Waker::noop() to satisfy clippy::manual_noop_waker</li>
<li>Use Waker::noop() to satisfy clippy::manual_noop_waker (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4543203682" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1004" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1004/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1004">#1004</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cli)</em> Shutdown databases before export (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4543241447" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1005" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1005/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1005">#1005</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🚜 Refactor</h3>
<ul>
<li>Extend BlockRefMeta and use on the other drivers (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4543344718" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1006" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1006/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1006">#1006</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>
<ul>
<li>Add performance subsection (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4532942737" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1001" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1001/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1001">#1001</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>
<ul>
<li>Update preview enactments (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4429808069" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/996" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/996/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/996">#996</a>)</li>
<li><em>(minibf)</em> Upgrade blockfrost crate to 0.1.88 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4535467086" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1002" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1002/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1002">#1002</a>)</li>
<li><em>(trp)</em> Bump tx3-cardano and tx3-resolver to 0.21.0 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4562737080" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/1008" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/1008/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/1008">#1008</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Install dolos 1.2.0</h2>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via shell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.2.0/dolos-installer.sh | sh"><pre>curl --proto <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">'</span>=https<span class="pl-pds">'</span></span> --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.2.0/dolos-installer.sh <span class="pl-k">|</span> sh</pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c &quot;irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.2.0/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex&quot;"><pre>powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">"</span>irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.2.0/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex<span class="pl-pds">"</span></span></pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="brew install txpipe/tap/dolos"><pre>brew install txpipe/tap/dolos</pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries into your npm project</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="npm install @txpipe/dolos@1.2.0"><pre>npm install @txpipe/dolos@1.2.0</pre></div>
