        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Release Notes</h2>
<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(u5c)</em> Serve v1alpha and v1beta gRPC side-by-side (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4369406307" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/987" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/987/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/987">#987</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Stage van Rossem fork - protocol v11 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4383562720" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/990" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/990/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/990">#990</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(minibf)</em> Add v11 new cost model mapping names (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4374634150" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/988" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/988/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/988">#988</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Short-circuit ewrap replay between boundary phases (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4385325910" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/991" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/991/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/991">#991</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Install dolos 1.1.1</h2>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via shell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.1.1/dolos-installer.sh | sh"><pre>curl --proto <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">'</span>=https<span class="pl-pds">'</span></span> --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.1.1/dolos-installer.sh <span class="pl-k">|</span> sh</pre></div>
