        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Release Notes</h2>
<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(minibf)</em> Introduce <code>/accounts/{account}/withdrawals</code> (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4304772265" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/974" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/974/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/974">#974</a>)</li>
<li><em>(minibf)</em> Introduce <code>/pools/{pool_id}/metadata</code> endpoint (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4304889803" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/975" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/975/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/975">#975</a>)</li>
<li><em>(minibf)</em> Introduce <code>/pools/{pool_id}</code> endpoint (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4305487330" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/976" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/976/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/976">#976</a>)</li>
<li><em>(utxorpc)</em> Implement read_genesis / read_era_summary queries (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4248384607" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/964" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/964/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/964">#964</a>)</li>
<li><em>(wal)</em> Version on-disk schema and force-reset on incompatibility (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4351190048" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/984" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/984/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/984">#984</a>)</li>
<li><em>(u5c)</em> Allow LedgerContext to query archive for spent UTxOs (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4234026506" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/962" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/962/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/962">#962</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(sync)</em> Apply deltas before WAL commit so rollback undo works (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4353202171" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/985" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/985/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/985">#985</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🚜 Refactor</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Move delta structs alongside entities (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4276906390" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/968" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/968/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/968">#968</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Enforce undo axiom via proptest (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4282488471" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/971" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/971/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/971">#971</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Shard mem-hungry work units (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4328352510" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/978" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/978/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/978">#978</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>📚 Documentation</h3>
<ul>
<li>Reconcile schema and minibf coverage with code (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4354574355" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/986" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/986/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/986">#986</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>🧪 Testing</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(minikupo)</em> Add comprehensive unit test coverage (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4048577765" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/939" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/939/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/939">#939</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks</h3>
<ul>
<li>Update tx3 to v0.17.0 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4263403730" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/965" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/965/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/965">#965</a>)</li>
<li><em>(minibf)</em> Upgrade minibf to version 0.1.87 (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4304716710" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/973" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/973/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/973">#973</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Update proposal outcomes (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4336011981" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/979" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/979/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/979">#979</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cardano)</em> Update proposal outcomes (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4351055736" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/983" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/983/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/983">#983</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Install dolos 1.1.0</h2>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via shell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.1.0/dolos-installer.sh | sh"><pre>curl --proto <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">'</span>=https<span class="pl-pds">'</span></span> --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.1.0/dolos-installer.sh <span class="pl-k">|</span> sh</pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c &quot;irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.1.0/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex&quot;"><pre>powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">"</span>irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.1.0/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex<span class="pl-pds">"</span></span></pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="brew install txpipe/tap/dolos"><pre>brew install txpipe/tap/dolos</pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries into your npm project</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="npm install @txpipe/dolos@1.1.0"><pre>npm install @txpipe/dolos@1.1.0</pre></div>
