        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Release Notes</h2>
<h3>🐛 Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>(cli)</em> Reset wal after any kind of bootstrap (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4101013117" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/950" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/950/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/950">#950</a>)</li>
<li><em>(cli)</em> Generate deterministic snapshots by removing file metadata (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4101536230" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/issues/951" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/txpipe/dolos/pull/951/hovercard" href="https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/pull/951">#951</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Install dolos 1.0.2</h2>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via shell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.0.2/dolos-installer.sh | sh"><pre>curl --proto <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">'</span>=https<span class="pl-pds">'</span></span> --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.0.2/dolos-installer.sh <span class="pl-k">|</span> sh</pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c &quot;irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.0.2/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex&quot;"><pre>powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c <span class="pl-s"><span class="pl-pds">"</span>irm https://github.com/txpipe/dolos/releases/download/v1.0.2/dolos-installer.ps1 | iex<span class="pl-pds">"</span></span></pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="brew install txpipe/tap/dolos"><pre>brew install txpipe/tap/dolos</pre></div>
<h3>Install prebuilt binaries into your npm project</h3>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="npm install @txpipe/dolos@1.0.2"><pre>npm install @txpipe/dolos@1.0.2</pre></div>
